Source-to-file mapping
----------------------

  tools/computer_use/schema.py
    -> src/schema.ts
    -> test/schema.test.ts
       Single computer_use schema, action discriminator, capture/input/delivery and
       capture-after fields. The fixed source enum contains 14 actions; Agnes does
       not invent a fifteenth action despite an erroneous count in an execution-plan
       checklist.

  tools/computer_use/tool.py
    -> src/tool.ts, src/safety.ts, src/result.ts
    -> test/tool.test.ts, test/safety.test.ts, test/result.test.ts
       Dispatch, safety blocks, sticky target guard, screenshot deduplication,
       capture-after, verdicts, 100-element/40-line/120-character limits and 8x8
       minimum image handling.

  tools/computer_use/backend.py
    -> src/backend.ts
    -> test/tool.test.ts, test/result.test.ts
       Typed capture, element, action, image and backend/provider contracts.

  tools/computer_use/cua_backend.py
  tools/computer_use/cua_backend_capture.py
  tools/computer_use/cua_backend_input.py
  tools/computer_use/cua_backend_daemon.py
    -> src/cua-backend.ts, src/policy.ts
    -> test/tool.test.ts, test/safety.test.ts, test/policy.test.ts
       Sticky exact target, opaque snapshot token binding, input translation,
       scroll clamp, foreground/background arguments and immutable standard,
       bounded/session-unrestricted runtime-mode evidence. Process, transport,
       capability-manifest enforcement, platform capture and real driver integration
       remain Host-owned.

  tools/computer_use/cua_backend_parse.py
    -> src/parse.ts
    -> test/result.test.ts, test/tool.test.ts
       MCP 1.x/2.x snake_case/camelCase envelopes, structuredContent precedence,
       versioned text element fallback, placeholder identifiers, zero bounds,
       typed frames, Host-normalized image references and action verdict parsing.

  skills/autonomous-ai-agents/computer-use/SKILL.md
    -> skill/SKILL.md
    -> test/skill.test.ts
       Agnes wrapper workflow guidance: capture -> fresh element -> verify,
       background verdict ladder, 14 wrapper actions, platform shortcuts,
       hard safety blocks and failure handling. The adaptation intentionally
       removes Hermes CLI/config/media instructions and never exposes the raw
       cua-driver vocabulary as callable tools.

